    <string name="notif_perm_body">The media card in the notification shade and on the lock screen needs notification permission. Without it you won\'t see any controls while the timer runs — they only appear briefly when it rings.</string>

    <!-- How it works -->
    <string name="note_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="note_body">After you tap start, Lap Alarm keeps time itself and rings, vibrates and wakes the screen when time is up.\n\nThe media card in the notification shade and lock screen controls it directly: play to start or resume, pause to hold, stop to end. You can also drag the progress bar to move the remaining time forward or back.</string>

